{
  "about": "How an SDK records a generation's messages (set_input / setInput and set_output / setOutput on a generation from start_generation / startGeneration). `direction` says which setter: input writes gen_ai.input.messages with default role user, output writes gen_ai.output.messages with default role assistant. `messages` is that attribute's JSON, parsed. `context_sizes` is rius.context.sizes, parsed. A lone string is one message with the default role, a lone mapping is one message, a missing role is the default role, and an explicit null role is kept on the message but reported as user in rius.context.sizes, the role whose bytes it counts under.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "single_string_input",
      "direction": "input",
      "value": "hello",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "hello"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "context_sizes": {
        "version": 1,
        "input_messages": [
          {
            "role": "user",
            "parts": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "bytes": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "single_string_output",
      "direction": "output",
      "value": "done",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "done"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "context_sizes": {
        "version": 1,
        "output_messages": [
          {
            "role": "assistant",
            "parts": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "bytes": 4
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "single_message_mapping_output",
      "direction": "output",
      "value": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "hi"
      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "hi"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "context_sizes": {
        "version": 1,
        "output_messages": [
          {
            "role": "assistant",
            "parts": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "bytes": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
